1
00:00:00,119 --> 00:00:02,579
This is what my boat looks like now compared to before.

2
00:00:02,899 --> 00:00:07,119
Before, I had rods everywhere. In the boat, in the garage, all over the place.

3
00:00:07,399 --> 00:00:11,439
Lines that got tangled up every single time. Now I've got four holders in place.

4
00:00:11,539 --> 00:00:13,099
Each rod has its own spot.

5
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:16,139
No tangles, no stress before I head out.

6
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,659
I put them up in five minutes.

7
00:00:18,079 --> 00:00:22,679
Didn't really need a drill. They're mounted on the wall at home and in the boat.

8
00:00:22,739 --> 00:00:25,019
Sturdy, they hold just as they should.

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:30,619
If you fish regularly, you'll understand straight away why this is worth it. Simple thing, big difference.
